  "goodToKnow": "Manipulieren means to manipulate people or to tamper with things: eine Wahl manipulieren, Daten manipulieren, Menschen manipulieren. Germany's best-known example is the 2015 Abgasskandal (diesel emissions scandal), when Volkswagen was found to have manipulated software to cheat emissions tests. Die Manipulation is manipulation. From Latin manus (hand): handling things for a hidden purpose. Past participle: manipuliert."
